OL,3,AMatt Lucas and Hugh Bonneville among
OL,4,Aactors calling for law on AI voice
OL,5,Acloning
OL,6,
OL,7,FActors including Matt Lucas, Hugh
OL,8,FBonneville and Nicola Coughlan have
OL,9,Fwritten to the UK government demanding
OL,10,Fgreater protection against their voices
OL,11,Fbeing used by AI.
OL,13,FThe performers are asking Prime
OL,14,FMinister Andy Burnham to introduce
OL,15,Flegislation which would give every
OL,16,Fperson in the UK a legal right to own
OL,17,Ftheir voice.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
